  "step_3": "The individual considers the maximum outcomes (2400 vs. 2500) and acknowledges a small difference in probabilities (1%), but does not apply the decision reason’s rule — which involves calculating the weighted maximum outcome (i.e., outcome × probability) and comparing those values. The justification is based on a subjective judgment about whether a 100€ loss is acceptable due to a small probability difference, not on a formal weighting of the maximum outcome. Therefore, while the individual touches on the maximum outcomes, they do not use the specific rule of the decision reason (weighting the maximum outcome by probability). The reason was not applied in the described deliberation process.",
  "final_assessment_score": 20
